@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title get_state 数据流 — 重构前后对比 (intention #20)

actor Client as "前端/API调用方"

box "Controller Layer" #LightYellow
    participant API as "api.py"
    participant Serializer as "serializers.py"
end box

box "App Layer" #LightBlue
    participant AppMgr as "AppManager"
    participant Conv as "Converter"
end box

box "Game Layer" #LightGreen
    participant GC as "GameCore"
    participant GS as "GameState"
    participant PS as "PlayerState"
end box

== 重构前 (dict) ==

Client -> API: GET /api/games/{id}
API -> GC: gm.get_state()
note right of GC: 返回嵌套 dict\nhand: ["attack"...]\nstatuses: [{"type":"defense"...}]
GC --> API: dict
API -> API: state["ai"] = metadata["ai"]
API --> Client: jsonify(state)

Client -> AppMgr: create_game()
AppMgr -> GC: gm.get_state()
GC --> AppMgr: dict
AppMgr -> AppMgr: state["ai"] = ai_name
AppMgr --> Client: (game_id, dict)

AppMgr -> Conv: build_input_vector(state_dict, "2")
note right of Conv: 通过 dict 键访问\nstate["players"]["2"]["hand"]

== 重构后 (GameState) ==

Client -> API: GET /api/games/{id}
API -> GC: gm.get_state()
GC -> GS: **new** GameState(...)
GC -> PS: **new** PlayerState(hp=..., hand=[CardType...], ...)
note right of GC: 返回类型化 GameState\nhand: list[CardType]\nstatuses: list[PlayerStatus]
GC --> API: GameState
API -> Serializer: game_state_to_dict(gs)
Serializer -> GS: GameState.to_dict(gs)
note right of Serializer: CardType → str\nPlayerStatus → dict\nPlayerHistoryItem → dict
Serializer --> API: dict
API -> API: state_dict["ai"] = metadata["ai"]
API --> Client: jsonify(state_dict)

Client -> AppMgr: create_game()
AppMgr -> GC: gm.get_state()
GC --> AppMgr: GameState
AppMgr --> Client: (game_id, GameState)

AppMgr -> Conv: build_input_vector(GameState, "2")
note right of Conv: 通过属性访问\nstate.players["2"].hand\n返回 list[CardType]

@enduml
